msgstr "Fournir, entretenir et améliorer les services de notre site Web."

#: .\podcasts\templates\podcasts\signup.html:210
#: .\podcasts\templates\socialaccount\signup.html:111
msgid "Protect our website and users against fraudulent activities and scams."
